+
+Rules this file keeps (the DAG processor re-imports it every few seconds, and
+workers import it before every task):
+- Parse fast: the registry is read once per parse with the libyaml loader, and
+  a worker running a task builds only that task's DAG.
+- Deterministic: nothing depends on the clock, the hash seed, set order or the
+  other configs, so a parse only creates a new DAG version when its config (or
+  the registry entries it uses) changes.
